{"version":1,"key":"card:741","content":{"id":741,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"<img>","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<figure> ","type":"formatted"},{"text":"和","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":" <picture> ","type":"formatted"},{"text":"是三个含义相近的 HTML 标签，从字面意思上看，三者似乎都和图片有关，所以有必要区分一下它们各自的职责和适用场景。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2c954928-b08e-435a-a1bc-1d1eaf2d7e14","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"<img>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是最基础的图片标签，职责很单纯，就是显示一张图片：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"15d331ba-c95c-4215-bb92-9d16f8bab0a4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<img \n  src=\"photo.jpg\" \n  alt=\"一只猫在阳光下打盹\"\n  width=\"600\" \n  height=\"400\"\n  loading=\"lazy\"\n  decoding=\"async\"\n  srcset=\"photo-2x.jpg 2x, photo-3x.jpg 3x\"\n  sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 50vw\"\n/>","collabId":"653ddc22-1c51-48d6-a123-c5fab091a60b","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"3bbfcfd1-21a6-4b56-8a37-7e0b7875b1ed","language":"HTML","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"2085184e-abab-4d82-8f5c-ec87c7ee8706"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"<figure>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 在中文语境下常常被误以为就是\"图片\"，但在学术排版领域，figure 是一个专业术语，特指正文中可以独立拎出去、不影响主体阅读的、可以加注释和编号的内容块。因此 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<figure>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中不仅仅可以放图片，还可以放代码块、引用、音视频等内容。HTML 借用了这个概念，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<figure>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 在 HTML 中只是一个语义化的容器，常常配合 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<figcaption>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 标签一同使用，该标签作为整个块的标题或说明，一般放在开头或结尾。对于屏幕阅读器，会把 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<figcaption>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的文本作为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<figure>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 整体的描述。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4f4ff494-9f29-4bfa-a245-da651b55db58","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<!-- 包裹图片 -->\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"chart.png\" alt=\"2024年Q4营收对比图\" />\n  <figcaption>图1：2024年第四季度各产品线营收对比</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<!-- 包裹代码 -->\n<figure>\n  <pre><code>console.log('Hello')</code></pre>\n  <figcaption>示例：控制台输出</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<!-- 包裹引用 -->\n<figure>\n  <blockquote>设计是功能的表达。</blockquote>\n  <figcaption>—— Dieter Rams</figcaption>\n</figure>","collabId":"cf9605f1-d100-47aa-90a9-9fa1b0604887","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"57ff28e9-3d53-460d-9358-1118086be7cc","language":"HTML","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"982dd7de-049d-4b2d-8e24-5bc478514833"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"<picture>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是响应式图片的源选择器，解决的是\"同一张图在不同设备、不同网络条件下该用哪个文件\"的问题。它里面包含两类子元素：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e87e0673-b801-49cb-85c7-fec9f93c0b00","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"<source>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 标签，用来提供候选源，可以有零个或多个，通过匹配条件来决定是否启用：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6df32baf-38c0-48ed-b10d-053c56ddd719","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"media","type":"formatted"},{"text":" — 媒体查询（视口宽度、方向等）","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"aa55a4d6-749c-460e-9913-fe778b5cbdb7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"be1aa9bb-3d01-4fff-90e1-850e8d81a63a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"type","type":"formatted"},{"text":" — MIME 类型（用于格式检测，如 WebP、AVIF）","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"da08651d-6995-4ccc-b0dc-3aa63796247f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"88cb0ff3-f97f-4390-b450-405d609216fc","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"srcset","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"92dafccd-083a-4042-8d39-e6f8d18dcad9","contentId":5982,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":732,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":" + ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"sizes","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"64611099-a8f9-48b3-8bdb-51b50393eb16","contentId":4961,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":658,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":" — 分辨率/尺寸候选","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"323d8750-8ba8-4b2c-a093-f9180011c7e7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"47ce5c9f-2c89-4c29-8bee-820aa2829b8b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"d10da81a-533a-44b7-a1cc-ae50dd7eaa31","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"1572bb86-e906-491b-a567-f6ca82ed2677","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"<img>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 标签，必需，作为兜底和最终渲染的元素","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f2b05cbd-68f0-4480-a383-b66827248666","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"b409e433-02f1-4d5a-a218-4fe628c8f19c","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"7822de69-6e97-45d0-9253-f1c9a90a0079","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"<picture>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 本身不产生盒模型，样式应该加在内部的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<img>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 上。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"eb072528-641e-4014-a878-2c2164191ee5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<picture>\n  <source media=\"(min-width: 1200px)\" srcset=\"hero-large.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n  <source media=\"(min-width: 800px)\" srcset=\"hero-medium.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n  <source srcset=\"hero-small.jpg\" type=\"image/jpeg\" />\n  <img src=\"hero-fallback.jpg\" alt=\"英雄横幅图\" />\n</picture>","collabId":"0d70f6ae-cc0f-45b1-8f21-4a22ba12ad4c","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"54dd7f03-fc97-46d0-80cf-9261a30ac853","language":"HTML","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"6c85c61c-bd86-434b-9b8f-e21748801d88"},{"children":[{"text":"可见最终的渲染都落在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<img>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 上，而 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<figure>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<picture>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 则分别从语义和资源选择两个维度服务于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"<img>","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，并且二者并不冲突，完全可以一起使用：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"94b380d7-a950-4cda-8d5e-baae397891ed","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<figure>\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"landscape.avif\" type=\"image/avif\" />\n    <source media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" srcset=\"landscape.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n    <source srcset=\"portrait.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n    <img src=\"fallback.jpg\" alt=\"城市天际线日落景观\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </picture>\n  <figcaption>图3：从观景台拍摄的城市日落全景（2024年摄）</figcaption>\n</figure>","collabId":"6bb098e9-09be-4ab3-acd1-225f726471f1","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"f25517b5-d6f3-4968-9377-529e9f5ead2b","language":"HTML","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"69dd8b04-f9d2-44e0-b607-30dc06a6b96e"}],"tags":["HTML","概念对比"],"createTime":1779931287610,"updateTime":1793532635423,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532635423},"links":{"card:732":{"key":"card:732","type":"card","id":732},"card:658":{"key":"card:658","type":"card","id":658}}}